      "ArticleTitle": "A critical review of Dr. Charles S. Greene's article titled \"Managing the Care of Patients with Temporomandibular Disorders: a new Guideline for Care\" and a revision of the American Association for Dental Research's 1996 policy statement on temporomandibular disorders, approved by the AADR Council in March 2010, published in the Journal of the American Dental Association September 2010.",
